// error
// #3755: a call passing fewer arguments than the callee's params used to run
// spliceCallee's param-binding loop off the end of the call's argument list
// (`args[p]` with no bound check), panicking with "index out of range" on
// the --dump-ir path, which optimizes checker-rejected code. inlineEligible
// now declines the splice when the call's argument count does not match the
// callee's entry-block paramCount (compiler/optinline.bit).
fn a(x: i32) {}
fn f() { a() }
